### 1. Health Check - Verify API is running
GET {{apiUrl}}/health

###

### 2. List all pages (should be empty initially)
GET {{apiUrl}}/pages

###

### 3. Create a new page
POST {{apiUrl}}/pages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metaData": {
    "title": "Welcome to Schist",
    "tags": ["welcome", "getting-started"]
  },
  "content": "# Welcome to Schist\n\nThis is your first wiki page!\n\n## Features\n\n- Markdown support\n- File-based storage\n- Wiki-style linking with [[Page Links]]\n- Full-text search\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Create more pages\n2. Link them together\n3. Build your knowledge base\n\nHappy writing! 📝"
}

###

### 4. Create another page for testing
POST {{apiUrl}}/pages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metaData": {
    "title": "Project Ideas",
    "tags": ["projects", "ideas", "todo"]
  },
  "content": "# Project Ideas\n\nCollection of project ideas for development.\n\n## Web Development\n\n- Personal blog\n- Portfolio site\n- Wiki system (like Schist!)\n\n## CLI Tools\n\n- File organizer\n- Git helper scripts\n- Markdown processor\n\n## Learning Projects\n\n- API client\n- Database wrapper\n- Static site generator\n\nSee also: [[Welcome to Schist]]"
}

###

### 5. List all pages (should show created pages)
GET {{apiUrl}}/pages

###

### 6. Get specific page by slug
GET {{apiUrl}}/pages/welcome-to-schist

###

### 7. Get another page by slug
GET {{apiUrl}}/pages/project-ideas

###

### 8. Update existing page
PUT {{apiUrl}}/pages/welcome-to-schist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metaData": {
    "title": "Welcome to Schist - Updated",
    "tags": ["welcome", "getting-started", "updated"]
  },
  "content": "# Welcome to Schist - Updated! 🎉\n\nThis page has been updated to demonstrate the update functionality.\n\n## What's New\n\n- Updated content\n- New emoji in title\n- Additional tags\n- Updated timestamp\n\n## Original Features\n\n- Markdown support ✅\n- File-based storage ✅\n- Wiki-style linking with [[Project Ideas]] ✅\n- Full-text search ✅\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n- Page timestamps\n- Slug generation\n- Tag support\n- Content versioning\n\nCheck out [[Project Ideas]] for inspiration!"
}

###

### 9. Verify update worked
GET {{apiUrl}}/pages/welcome-to-schist

###

### 10. Test non-existent page (should return 404)
GET {{apiUrl}}/pages/non-existent-page

###

### 11. Search functionality (if implemented)
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?q=schist

###

### 12. Search for specific terms
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?q=project

###

### 13. Delete a page
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/pages/project-ideas

###

### 14. Verify deletion (should return 404)
GET {{apiUrl}}/pages/project-ideas

###

### 15. List pages again (should only show remaining page)
GET {{apiUrl}}/pages

###

### 16. Test error cases - Create page with invalid data
POST {{apiUrl}}/pages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invalid": "data"
}

###

### 17. Test creating page without metadata
POST {{apiUrl}}/pages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "# Simple Page\n\nJust content, no metadata."
}

###

### 18. Test CORS (for development)
OPTIONS {{apiUrl}}/pages
Origin: {{frontendUrl}}
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type

###

### 19. Cleanup - Delete remaining test pages
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/pages/welcome-to-schist

###

### 20. Verify cleanup
GET {{apiUrl}}/pages